sentences.text:
The term "Aggrieved Person" is defined in Section 2 (a) of Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 which is reproduced as under:
Indu Lata vs Harish Kumar on 4 January, 2014 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/168101843/
10 (a) "aggrieved person" means woman who is, or has been, in a domestic relationship with the respondent and who alleges to have been subjected to any act of domestic violence by the respondent;
